  characterName: "S\xF4nia Suru\xED"
  promptText: "A Swiss company wants to buy our newly reforested tribal land as carbon
    credits, for millions. If we accept, we lose control of our forest and the right
    to decide how it is used. Do I sell our sovereignty for cash, or keep the land
    in our people\u2019s hands?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, accept the offer; the funds can meet urgent needs now.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse; keeping control of your forest protects your future and
    your culture.
